Fresh off receiving five Grammy nominations, Don Toliver has announced that his sixth album &#8220;Nitrous&#8221; will be released on December 4 via Cactus Jack/Donnway & Co/Atlantic Records.

&#8220;Nitrous,&#8221; which Toliver has been teasing for some time, was recorded, produced and engineered entirely by himself. Toliver announced the album on social media with a clip that shows him working on music in something of a futuristic studio laboratory. Related Stories Dua Lipa, Tame Impala and SZA to Headline Coachella 2027

